 "metaDescription": "NCS is a leading provider of engineering and construction services, specializing in innovative solutions for complex projects across various industries.",
 "text": "Government of India\nToll Free Helpline - 1514\nLogin/Signup\nJobseekers\nEmployers\nCounsellors\nCareer Centers\nResources\nClassified Jobs\nFrequently Asked Questions\nGeneral\nFor Jobseekers\nFor Employers\nSupport\nWhat is NCS?\nThe National Career Service (NCS) is a one-stop solution offering a wide range of employment and career-related services to the citizens of India, including job search, job matching, career content, counselling, and job fair information. It is an initiative of the Ministry of Labour & Employment, Government of India.\nWho can register on the portal?\nIs NCS free to use?\nIs a mobile app available?\nHow can I avoid fake NCS communication?\nStill have questions?\n\nCan't find the answer you're looking for? Contact us now.\n\nGet in touch\nDirectorate General of Employment (DGE) Ministry of Labour & Employment Govt. of India, Shram Shakti Bhawan Rafi Marg, New Delhi-110001, India\nLast updated: 28-09-26\nNCS\nFor Jobseekers\nFor Employers\nFor Career Center\nFor Career Counsellor\nAbout us\nExplore Opportunities\nCareer Information\nJobs for Differently Abled\nGovernment Jobs\nInternational Jobs\nOther Links\nSitemap\nRight to Information\nDisclaimer\nFAQs\nImportant Links\nFeedback\nContact Us\nNational Career Service\n\n© 2026 Website contents are managed by Ministry of Labour & Employment, Government of India.\n\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy",
